  "id": "section-205",
  "title": "对全党干部研究列宁《左派幼稚病》一书的第二章的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-054.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>053）</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　请同志们看此书的第二章，使同志们懂得必须消灭现在存在于我们工作中的某些严重的无纪律状态，或无政府状态。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　《整风文献》</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-053.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-055.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
